*  CONTROL, GREEN -- the ONE-INGREDIENT twin of rty_arbno_leftctx_inline with the leading
*  BREAK removed, so the ARBNO is the LEFTMOST element of its group.  Extends and
*  terminates correctly (t/th/thi/this/...).  Proves ARBNO's OWN retry is sound in
*  isolation -- the defect needs a left neighbour ahead of the ARBNO to appear.
	&ANCHOR = 1
	subj = "this is a test ."
	subj ARBNO(LEN(1)) $ OUTPUT '.'
END
